OL,3,GNEWSANotting Hill Carnival criticism
OL,4,Aunfair, says boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of Notting Hill Carnival has
OL,7,Fsaid it was "unfair" to blame the event
OL,8,Ffor violence.
OL,10,FAt last year's event, the Met Police
OL,11,Fmade more than 500 arrests, mainly for
OL,12,Fdrug offences, as well as for
OL,13,Fpossession of an offensive weapon,
OL,14,Fsexual assault and violence.
OL,16,FAhead of this year's Carnival, the Met
OL,17,Fsaid officers would "relentlessly"
OL,18,Fpursue the "small minority who come
OL,19,Fintending to do harm", and had banned
OL,20,Fmore than 330 people from attending as
OL,21,Fpart of bail conditions. More than
OL,22,F7,000 officers will be deployed.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
