OL,3,GNEWSANotting Hill Carnival criticism
OL,4,Aunfair, says boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe event's chief executive, Matthew
OL,7,FPhillip, said it was "unfair that
OL,8,FCarnival is always targeted as a cause"
OL,9,Fof violence, adding: "It is a victim of
OL,10,Fcrime rather than a perpetrator."
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
